//! Golden-output guard for the code this repository generates.
//!
//! The crate has no library code. Its test (`tests/golden.rs`) regenerates
//! every 3GPP schema that nextgcore and nextgsim compile, with exactly the
//! settings their `build.rs` files use, and compares a SHA-256 of each output
//! against `golden/SHA256SUMS`. A change to the compiler that alters any
//! generated byte therefore fails CI until the golden file is updated on
//! purpose (`UPDATE_GOLDEN=1 cargo test -p codegen-golden`) and the diff is
//! reviewed.
